  "description": "Michaela, once a new bride, was beaten to the brink of death and forced into marriage with a foreign royal by her cruel stepfather. Neither side desired the union, and Michaela's husband, Leon, never even glanced her way. She was exiled to a remote, dilapidated countryside. Years passed, and Leon found someone he truly loved and dreamed of marrying. Seeking a fresh start, he sets out to find Michaela and request a divorce. But will she agree so easily?",
